+    # streamer intermittently delivers a zero-filled chunk for this fused
+    # special-case's source tensors (~50%/host on some launches) while
+    # marking it ready — an all-zero dequant output is physically
+    # impossible for real weights. When GLM_WK_OOB_DIR points at a local
